    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A Flechette Mine can cause grievous harm to anyone it damages. It contains thousands of tiny shards of metal that, when the Flechette Mine is triggered, fly into the air and bury themselves deeply into any targets within the blast radius. A Flechette Mine is placed on the ground (In any square adjacent to your) and is triggered when any&nbsp;character, creature, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>, or Vehicle enters the square in which it is placed. </p><p>A Flechette Mine damages everything in a 2-square&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. </p>",
